Essaim OS Documentation & Release Manifests
Copyright (c) 2026 Essaim OS (https://essaimos.com)

1. Documentation, Media Kit & Checksums
   The markdown documentation, promotional banners in `promo/`, issue
   templates, and SHA256 release manifests in this repository (`essaim-docs`)
   may be freely read, referenced, embedded, and shared to link back to or
   verify Essaim OS (https://essaimos.com).

2. Essaim OS Software & Binaries
   Compiled Essaim OS binaries, disk images, Hub containers, worker agents, and
   mobile applications distributed via https://essaimos.com are proprietary
   commercial software:
   - 1st worker rig per Hub is free to use without expiration.
   - Additional active worker rigs require a valid Essaim OS license key
     from https://essaimos.com/tarifs.
   - Redistribution, reverse engineering, or modification of distributed
     binaries to bypass licensing restrictions is not permitted.
